# A currency rather than litter: it sells for nothing, and the shop asks for it
# by the mark below instead of by meso. The triangle says which stage of the
# game it belongs to and the colour which piece it buys, so one glyph reads on
# both axes.
name: "Cygnus Shoulder Token"
category: ITEM_CATEGORY_ETC
description:
  "A feather from the Empress's own wing. The shop trades one for any "
  "Cygnus shoulder."
currency_mark: "▲"
currency_color: CURRENCY_COLOR_PURPLE
